  m_Name: Skein Cell Config 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  CellName: Skein
  Description: 'The Skein at intensity 1 - a trefoil-knot cable of 5 rails
    (4063 prisms) on BREATHING radii - each strand oscillates between 45
    and 135 with its own phase, so at every station the N strands cover the
    whole band and riding an outward-bound one carries you out. Cut into open
    AIMED
    segments. NO NUCLEUS and no food web by design: in a nucleus-less cell
    herbivores eat opposing-domain mass, so a swarm would graze whatever the
    TRAILING team had just painted. PhaseThresholds ride THIS intensity''s own
    measured baseline - regenerate with Tools/Build/author_skein_assets.py
    rather than hand-editing; the count x 16 derivation is 17x low here because
    a (6,6,8) prism is 288 volume against the nominal 16.'
